From 70dcb6f9f627a20020867a4cb9c77a0ac100acdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 14 May 2026 21:34:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: profile edit/logo, app icon, UI fixes

- ProfileSelect: Mapelo pin SVG logo replaces 'M' circle
- ProfileSelect: edit profile name (pencil icon)
- ProfileSelect: upload custom logo for profiles (camera icon)
- ProfileSelect: 'stworzone przez akApp' footer
- Settings: profile section shows uploaded logo
- Settings: extra bottom padding (footer no longer behind nav)
- NavBar: lang switcher uses safe-area-inset-top (no status bar overlap)
- Index: increased bottom padding for nav clearance (64->80px)
- Android: replaced default Capacitor icon with Mapelo pin icon
- Store: added updateProfile action, logo field on Profile
- i18n: added profileEdit, profileChangeLogo, madeBy keys (PL+EN)
